  "code": "def predict(tokens, prompt):\n    # E0001/E0003: output = highest-priority symbol present; priority po(5) > gu(3) > se(6) > ba(1) > ku(4)\n    # Mechanism: mlp0+mlp1 build a sort key per position (E0012), head 2.0 counts lower keys (E0009, E0011),\n    # mlp2 decodes the rank (E0012), head 3.1 at the last position copies the top-ranked token (E0008, E0013).\n    prio = {4: 0, 1: 1, 6: 2, 3: 3, 5: 4}\n    seq = [int(t) for t in tokens][1:]\n    return max(seq, key=lambda t: prio[t])\n",
